SUMMARY:PRIDE After Party!
DESCRIPTION:Saturday June 6th\, 2026\nDoors | 7:00 PM\nShow | 8:00 PM \nReserved Table & Riser Seating | $23.40 + Fees \nVIP Singles | $31.60 + Fees\nEnjoy premium seating on the main floor with our VIP singles\, ensuring a fantastic view of the stage and a comfortable\, intimate setting. Early Entry at 6:30pm  \nVIP Table | $32.65 + Fees x 4 = $130.60 + Fees per table\nIncludes 4 tickets. Enjoy premier seating on the main floor with our VIP tables\, ensuring a fantastic view of the stage and a comfortable\, intimate setting. Early Entry at 6:30pm – gather your crew and make a night of it! \nDiamond VIP Ticket *New this year!* |  Table | $60.10 + Fees x 4 = $240.40 + Fees / Singles | $60.10 + Fees\n-Early Entry begins at 6:00pm\n-Preshow Cocktail Hour with snacks\n-Backstage access with the queens\n-The full VIP experience from start to finish\n-Reserved Premier Seating \n+$5 on All Day of Show Purchases (+$20 on VIP Table. Excludes Diamond VIP Seating)\nPlease note this event is 18+ – 21+ With Valid ID to Drink\nCome hungry! Snacks and light bites will be available at the canteen.\n—————————————————\nPresented by Lancaster County Chooses Love & Mickey’s Black Box in conjuction with The Divas\n—————————————————\nJoin PRIDE After Party at Mickey’s Black Box ft. Winner of Canada’s Drag Race – VIRGO QUEEN\, ENIGMA\, Ashley Manhattan\, Diva Divine & Miss Felicia! \nShow Up and Show Out for Pride!  \nSpend the day at Lititz Pride Festival\, a celebration of community! It’s a day to gather\, to cheer\, to wave your flag high\, and to stand alongside the people who make Lancaster County a place where everyone belongs. This is the day our community comes together loud\, proud\, and in full color. \nThen\, Keep the Celebration Going at Mickey’s Black Box! \nWhen the sun goes down\, the after-party turns up. Join The Divas at Mickey’s Black Box for an unforgettable 18+ Drag Show — the perfect way to cap off a day of love and pride. Our queens are bringing their fiercest looks\, sharpest choreography\, and biggest personalities to the stage. Expect showstopping performances\, killer lip syncs\, and the kind of energy that only happens when our community celebrates together. \nCelebrate all day. Dance all night. \nSee you Saturday\, June 6th as we celebrate PRIDE with Mickey’s Black Box and Lancaster County Chooses Love!\n—————————————————\n*Ticket Alert*  \nTickets for Mickey’s Black Box are sold through TicketMaster\, via our website\, or in person at our Box Office. Any tickets purchased elsewhere will not be honored and we are not responsible for tickets purchased from any 3rd party sellers.  Do not google the name of the band to search for tickets.  Go to Mickeysblackbox.com ONLY. Mickeysblackbox.com will never direct you anywhere but the official TicketMaster event site. \n\nAll bags are subject are to search upon entry. Tickets are non-refundable\, save for instances in which performances are cancelled by Mickey’s Black Box. For more information about our venue or to make an ADA request\, please visit the FAQ page of our website: https://mickeysblackbox.com/faq/ or call our box office line at (717) 723 – 8463.
URL:https://mickeysblackbox.com/event/pride-after-party/
LOCATION:Mickey’s Black Box\, 101 Rock Lititz Boulevard\, Lititz\, PA\, 17543\, United States
ATTACH;FMTTYPE=image/jpeg:https://mickeysblackbox.com/app/uploads/2026/04/PrideMickeysV4Final-scaled-e1777228680261.jpg
END:VEVENT
