SUMMARY:Bruce Springsteen Tribute - The E Street Shuffle
DESCRIPTION:Friday June 12th\, 2026\nDoors | 7:00 PM\nShow | 8:00 PM \nGeneral Admission Standing Room | $33.65 + Fees\nReserved Riser Seating | $44.30 + Fees\nReserved Balcony & Mezzanine Seating | $44.30 + Fees \n+$5 on All Day of Show Purchases\nThis event is all ages – 21+ With Valid ID to Drink\nCome hungry! Snacks and light bites will be available at the canteen.\n—————————————————\nPresented by Big Fan Presents\n—————————————————\nThe E Street Shuffle is the nation’s premier Bruce Springsteen tribute act\, masterfully recreating the sonic landscape of the music while simultaneously embodying the spirit\, power and camaraderie of The E Street Band’s legendary live concerts.  \nHailing from Bruce’s own stomping grounds of Asbury Park\, NJ\, the band has rocked crowds across the country for the past two decades\, taking no prisoners and leaving it all on the stage each night! \nAn E Street Shuffle show keeps fans on their feet and screaming for more as they blast their way through everything from Springsteen’s monster stadium rock anthems to the deep cuts and fan favorites that span the career of the man they call “The Boss.” \nCheck out The E Street Band here!\n—————————————————\n*Ticket Alert*  \nTickets for Mickey’s Black Box are sold through TicketMaster\, via our website\, or in person at our Box Office. Any tickets purchased elsewhere will not be honored and we are not responsible for tickets purchased from any 3rd party sellers.  Do not google the name of the band to search for tickets.  Go to Mickeysblackbox.com ONLY. Mickeysblackbox.com will never direct you anywhere but the official TicketMaster event site. \n\nAll bags are subject are to search upon entry. Tickets are non-refundable\, save for instances in which performances are cancelled by Mickey’s Black Box. For more information about our venue or to make an ADA request\, please visit the FAQ page of our website: https://mickeysblackbox.com/faq/ or call our box office line at (717) 723 – 8463.
URL:https://mickeysblackbox.com/event/bruce-springsteen-tribute-the-e-street-shuffle/
LOCATION:Mickey’s Black Box\, 101 Rock Lititz Boulevard\, Lititz\, PA\, 17543\, United States
ATTACH;FMTTYPE=image/jpeg:https://mickeysblackbox.com/app/uploads/2026/02/Untitled-42-e1772202755902.jpeg
END:VEVENT
